upwards for wellness), improve job satisfaction, working memory and cognition. Our customer feedback survey reported a 98% satisfaction with ShineVR.\n\nFor the Healthcare customer, ShineVR Chronic Pain is in development for the treatment of Chronic Lower Back Pain. Our televised pilot study showed a reduction of 33% in pain perception with our target patient. ShineVR Chronic Pain is in development, and actively recruiting pilot study participants.", "short_description": "ShineVR is an immersive Cognitive Behavioural Therapy (CBT) platform delivering data driven, personalised experiences for Enterprise and Healthcare customers. The platform consists of a series of immersive spaces, each containing activities based on evidence informed techniques.  Personalised programs deliver guided paths through activities designed to achieve an outcome."}]}, "developer_name": "ShineVR", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vstream.ie/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://vstream.ie/terms-of-use/", "publisher_name": "ShineVR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://shine-vr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "478089301798119"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9989676084395977"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3766908416873932"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "3766908416873932"}, "is_approved": true, "firstO